            "@type": "Question",
            "name": "What is your pricing policy?",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
                "@type": "Answer",
                 "text": "Because we work with Games, Marketing, Films, VFX, and AR/VR, all our projects are unique. We take every project into careful consideration and form the price in accordance with the client&#039;s needs. We do not stick to a rigid price list but aim to form fair and affordable prices.  However, as guidance: we create characters starting from $1000, Animation for around $30-50/per second depending on complexity, and VFX reel starting from $2000."
            }
        }
                        ,
                            {
            "@type": "Question",
            "name": "How long does it take to deliver a project?",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
                "@type": "Answer",
                 "text": "Each project is unique and requires a varying amount of effort and time. Trusting our team of professional 3D artists, you can be sure that it will be delivered as fast as possible in this industry and with the utmost quality. Definitely faster than any huge and slow old-school company."
            }
        }
                        ,
                            {
            "@type": "Question",
            "name": "Do you offer grand scale all-in-one production?",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
                "@type": "Answer",
                 "text": "Yes, as a creative studio, we are able to produce everything you might need in-house. We do Concept Art, 3D modeling of Characters and Assets, Texturing, Rigging, Animation of any complexity, Environment Design, Lighting, complex Particle Simulations, Render, Compositing, post-processing, Video Editing, and Color Grading. Uniting all this, we can deliver a project of any scale."
            }
        }
                        ,
                            {
            "@type": "Question",
            "name": "Do you work with emerging technologies such as AR, VR, and NFT?",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
                "@type": "Answer",
                 "text": "Yes, we do. We have extensive experience in AR Application Development, Modeling for VR, Development of VR experiences. We also worked with Web3.0 GLB formats and created 3D assets for websites. As for NFT, we made lots of them, and one collection actually got to be Number One in OpenSea Trending."
            }
        }
                        ,
                            {
            "@type": "Question",
            "name": "Can you film videos for VFX shots?",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
                "@type": "Answer",
                 "text": "Yes, we also have a team of professional Videographers with gorgeous cameras. We can film 4k footages."
            }
        }
